        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/extras/e6fca998ca44bc7180ac3e956598085a.poster.avif?t=1780437380\" aria-label=\"Giant spider attacks the player\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/extras/e6fca998ca44bc7180ac3e956598085a.webm?t=1780437380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/extras/e6fca998ca44bc7180ac3e956598085a.mp4?t=1780437380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RETURN TO TRAHULARA</strong> is a Stylized, third person sci fi shooter. Chaotic, retro-style shoot and run gameplay, combined with multiple factions of NPC’s that fight each other for survival, with or without your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the linear mission based storyline or use the dev-mod panel to create your own freeform battle scenarios, and teleport to whichever space-Island you want to liberate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free the tribal warriors!  - Release the giant Harvester Spiders! - Take control of the enemy droid army!  - Do whatever it takes to.... <strong>RETURN TO TRAHULARA</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/extras/e6fca998ca44bc7180ac3e956598085a.poster.avif?t=1780437380\" aria-label=\"Giant spider attacks the player\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/extras/e6fca998ca44bc7180ac3e956598085a.webm?t=1780437380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/extras/e6fca998ca44bc7180ac3e956598085a.mp4?t=1780437380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RETURN TO TRAHULARA</strong> is a Stylized, third person sci fi shooter. Chaotic, retro-style shoot and run gameplay, combined with multiple factions of NPC’s that fight each other for survival, with or without your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the linear mission based storyline or use the dev-mod panel to create your own freeform battle scenarios, and teleport to whichever space-Island you want to liberate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free the tribal warriors!  - Release the giant Harvester Spiders! - Take control of the enemy droid army!  - Do whatever it takes to.... <strong>RETURN TO TRAHULARA</strong>.</p>",
